<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68190" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνημόσῠνον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>remembrance, memorial</i>
			of a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνημόσυνον ἑωυτοῦ λιπέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.185
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				4.166
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνημόσυνον λιπέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.186
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				2.101
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνημόσυνα ἀποδέξασθαι</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				148
			</span></i>, al.: rare in early 
				Att.
			 Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. στοργῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.68
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς μ. τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					26.13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				10.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>memorandum, reminder</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνημόσυνα γράψομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					538
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τουτὶ . . ἔστω τὸ μ. μοι</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				559
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>mark, scar</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ὑποκαταλιπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prorrh.</u>
					2.20
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
